 ],
 "text": "Peak Season is here, and your support inbox is about to triple. AI can answer most of it. Where's my order? Can I change my size? When does it ship? But the brands that keep customers know when the AI should step aside. Five handoffs. Angry customers go to a person. Money decisions over your limit go to a person. Broken or missing items? The AI collects the photos, a person decides. Anyone asking for the second time. And anyone who says, talk to a human. Want the full handoff map? Comment, systems, and we'll send it to you free."
